WRITE | b.pdl | W | only | 7\n
WRITE | c.pdl | W | a | 0\nW | b | 0\n
WRITE | d.pdl | W | good | 4\nW | neg | -3\nW | word | abc\nW | frac | 2.5\nX | other | 9\nW |  | 5\nW | big | 4\n
WRITE | e.pdl | 
